WEBVTT

NOTE Captions for t2-02-rupture-repair.mp3 — machine-transcribed on-device from the existing audio (SR-472). Not proofread.
NOTE Cues with ids phase-recognise/-regulate/-release/-rise mark where each step begins; js/saferise-poster.js reads them.

00:00:02.220 --> 00:00:08.530
Something remains unsaid and open between you and another person. And right
now, neither of you has made a move.

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:13.690
This practice does not sit in judgment of who was right, nor does it seek to
audit what happened.

00:00:46.830 --> 00:00:51.330
It's sole purpose is to regulate the internal storm you are carrying about it.

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:08.580
Your physical body registers the impact first.

00:01:08.850 --> 00:01:11.740
Long before the analytical mind can structure an argument.

00:01:27.080 --> 00:01:32.470
And most of our distress lives in the gap between physical sensation and
mental narrative.

00:01:47.060 --> 00:01:49.800
Let us navigate four clear steps together.

phase-recognise
00:02:04.550 --> 00:02:09.870
First, we recognise where this rupture rests in your body before any words
attached to it.

00:02:10.340 --> 00:02:13.110
It often leaves as a jeep ache in the heart space.

00:02:13.330 --> 00:02:15.270
A tightness in the pit of the stomach.

00:02:15.480 --> 00:02:18.690
Or restless energy in the hands that longs to reach out.

00:02:19.210 --> 00:02:24.130
Summarize this physical sensation in a single word, such as raw or unseckled.

00:02:39.840 --> 00:02:48.431
Notice how much that single word leaves out. It drops the entire running tape
of who said what, who started it, and who holds the blame. You hold one

00:02:48.431 --> 00:02:50.910
account of the story and they hold another.

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:16.950
The discrepancy itself is not a failure but a natural reflection of two
separated human operating systems.

00:03:33.010 --> 00:03:36.900
We are stepping away from the case files to tend directly to your nervous
system.

00:03:57.640 --> 00:04:02.660
Sink one layer deeper to the vulnerability of not knowing if this bridge will
be rebuilt.

00:04:02.900 --> 00:04:12.068
And let that uncertainty exist without trying to solve it right now. Now, we
regulate the body so you can step out of fight or flight. Breathe in deeply

00:04:12.068 --> 00:04:14.420
for 6 counts, feeling your ribs expand.

00:04:29.020 --> 00:04:31.220
And release out slowly for 6 counts.

00:04:31.740 --> 00:04:35.390
Direct your compassionate focus straight into the egg in your chest.

00:04:36.060 --> 00:04:41.790
If you feel the intense somatic pull to reach for your phone to check for a
message or send a defensive text,

00:04:42.060 --> 00:04:43.950
Gently ask those hands to rest.

00:04:44.280 --> 00:04:48.630
Let every anxious thought arrive without following it or finishing the story.

00:04:48.870 --> 00:04:55.030
Third, we choose to release the exhaustion of keeping score. There are two
distinct processes occurring.

00:04:55.280 --> 00:04:57.840
The real painful rupture that occurred

00:05:12.180 --> 00:05:15.090
And the mental accounting you are performing to prove your innocence

00:05:29.290 --> 00:05:35.340
The mental tally feels like seeking clarity, but it is actually a defense
mechanism preparing for battle.

00:05:35.640 --> 00:05:38.130
And battle requires a winner and a loser.

00:05:54.230 --> 00:05:58.330
Let the rupture just be what it is, but drop the weight of the accounting.

00:05:58.550 --> 00:06:00.320
Take a dedicated moment

00:06:00.720 --> 00:06:02.920
To thank your heart and your inner focus

00:06:03.170 --> 00:06:11.790
for shining the light on what has really been steering this painful trigger.
The urgent concern that your honesty and standing needed constant protection

00:06:12.070 --> 00:06:20.415
Was completely valid yet running that legal defense continuously in the
background has been exhausting your battery give thanks to the vigilant part

00:06:20.415 --> 00:06:22.840
of you that stepped up to shield your worth

00:06:22.600 --> 00:06:29.060
And let it know that you are taking over the lid now. Hold that tender and
protected space inside your brain.

00:06:42.760 --> 00:06:47.330
Lastly, we rise to meet the relationship from wisdom rather than panic.

00:06:47.650 --> 00:06:56.720
Picture yourself sitting here, holding a valid hurt, yet choosing not to let
the conflict run your system. Now envision standing in their shoes for just

00:06:56.720 --> 00:06:58.450
five seconds. Not to agree or

00:06:58.210 --> 00:07:02.210
But to acknowledge their human nervous system across from yours.

00:07:22.580 --> 00:07:30.162
Step into the version of yourself who approaches repair with emotional
maturity holding your boundaries while focusing on the single move that

00:07:30.162 --> 00:07:33.740
belongs to you what is the precise clean sentence you want to offer

00:07:33.500 --> 00:07:38.050
Feel what it is like to embody that grounded version of yourself right now.

00:07:55.550 --> 00:07:59.110
Choose one honest action you will take to initiate repair.

00:08:15.400 --> 00:08:17.830
Leaving their response entirely up to them.

00:08:38.820 --> 00:08:42.210
Take one slow, restorative breath in for six.

00:08:56.360 --> 00:08:57.940
And let it go for six

00:09:11.920 --> 00:09:17.740
Reconnect with the physical weight of your body against the chair. Wiggle your
fingers, open your eyes.

00:09:17.990 --> 00:09:21.410
And return here whenever you need to restore your inner equilibrium.
